---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Speaking & Writing
pageDescription: "Twenty-nine talks around the world — CSUN, WebAIM, EuroSTAR, M-Enabling, Agile Testing Days — plus W3C standards work and publications."
permalink: /speaking/
footerSpaced: true
navCta:
  label: Book me to speak
  url: /#contact
---
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="page-hero-tight" aria-labelledby="speaking-h">
    <h1 class="page-title" id="speaking-h">Speaking &amp; writing</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ speaking.intro }}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="upcoming" aria-labelledby="upcoming-h">
    <h2 id="upcoming-h" class="visually-hidden">Upcoming engagements</h2>
    <ul class="upcoming-list" role="list">
      {%- for item in speaking.upcoming %}
      <li>
        <span class="tag tag-accent">Upcoming · {{ item.when }}</span>
        <span>{{ item.what }}</span>
        <span class="upcoming-where">{{ item.where }}</span>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="split split-video" aria-labelledby="featured-h">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Featured talk</p>
      <h2 id="featured-h" class="section-title">{{ speaking.featured.title }}</h2>
      <p class="prose prose-narrow">{{ speaking.featured.copy }}</p>
      <p class="btn-row"><a href="{{ speaking.featured.watchUrl }}" class="btn btn-ghost">Watch on YouTube<span class="visually-hidden"> (external site)</span></a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="video-frame">
      {#- Titled, so it is announced as something meaningful when a
          screen-reader user lands on it in the frames list.

          cc_load_policy=1 turns captions on by default. Embedding a video
          makes its captions this page's responsibility under SC 1.2.2, and
          that cannot be verified from here — confirm the upload is captioned
          on YouTube (auto-generated captions do not satisfy 1.2.2).
          See docs/accessibility.md. -#}
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ speaking.featured.videoId }}?cc_load_policy=1"
              title="{{ speaking.featured.videoTitle }}"
              loading="lazy"
              allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture"
              allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-talks" aria-labelledby="talks-h">
    <p class="kicker">On stage</p>
    <h2 id="talks-h" class="section-title">Selected talks</h2>
    {#- A table wider than a narrow viewport scrolls inside its own region
        rather than dragging the page sideways. The region is focusable so it
        can be scrolled from the keyboard, and named so its purpose is clear. -#}
    <section class="scroll-region" tabindex="0"
             aria-label="Selected talks table, scrolls horizontally on small screens">
      <table class="table table-talks">
        <caption class="visually-hidden">Selected conference talks by year, title and event</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="col-year">Year</th>
            <th scope="col">Talk</th>
            <th scope="col">Event</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {%- for talk in speaking.talks %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ talk.year }}</td>
            <td>{{ talk.title }}</td>
            <td class="cell-event"{% if talk.eventLang %} lang="{{ talk.eventLang }}"{% endif %}>{{ talk.event }}</td>
          </tr>
          {%- endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <p class="table-note">Full history — 29 talks since 2022 — available on request, or see <a href="{{ site.links.empowerTalks }}">empoweraccessibility.com/talks</a>.</p>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="band" aria-labelledby="standards-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Standards &amp; community</p>
    <h2 id="standards-h" class="section-title">Helping write the rules of the web</h2>
    <ul class="grid grid-standards" role="list">
      {%- for entry in speaking.standards %}
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="card-kicker">{{ entry.title | safe }}</h3>
        <p class="card-body">{{ entry.body | safe }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <section class="section-pubs" aria-labelledby="pubs-h">
    <p class="kicker">In print</p>
    <h2 id="pubs-h" class="section-title">Publications</h2>
    <ul class="pub-list" role="list">
      {%- for pub in speaking.publications %}
      <li>
        {%- if pub.href %}<a href="{{ pub.href }}">{{ pub.title }}<span class="visually-hidden"> (external site)</span></a>
        {%- else %}<span>{{ pub.title }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="pub-meta"> — {{ pub.meta | safe }}</span>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <hr class="hr">

  <section class="section-close" aria-labelledby="speaker-cta-h">
    <h2 id="speaker-cta-h" class="section-title-sm">Need a speaker or trainer?</h2>
    <p class="prose">Keynotes, workshops and panels on accessibility, AI and inclusive technology — in English or French, in person or remote. Speaker bio, headshot and session abstracts available on request.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact me</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
